 "signature": null,
 "observations": [
  "col_left L1: the bars of «al-Farghānī» are printed (the last 2.6 by 1.1 points). A triangular blot (1.8 by 1.2 points) under the a after F, 2.1-3.3 points below the baseline, and a speck above the A of «(Alfraganus)» are not transcribed (the name has no letter that Nallino marks with a dot below).",
  "col_left L3: the comma after «(em. n. 1)» is printed short, with a small tail (1.3 by 1.9 points, 0.8 point below the baseline).",
  "col_left L7, L8, L36, L44: «*al-farwardaǵān*», «*ferīǵiyūn*», «*al-ǵabhah*» and «*ǵadwal*» are printed with ǵ, Nallino's sign for jīm; the ball at the end of the tail of the italic g stands apart from the letter in «*al-ǵabhah*» and in the words ǵawzahar and ǵayb of the right column (L14, L16); it is not a dot below.",
  "col_left L15: «Finḥās» has the ḥ sort; «Ṭāṭā» has dots under both t's; «al-‘Ibrānī» has the sign of ‘ayn.",
  "col_left L16: the comma after «(editiones)» is printed short, with a small tail (1.3 by 1.8 points, 0.3 point below the baseline).",
  "col_left L19: the mark over the last i of «al-Fīrūzābādī» is a thick bar (2.0 by 1.3 points, flat at top and bottom; the first ī of the name has a bar 1.9 by 1.1, the dots of this type are round, 1.2-1.6 points); transcribed ī.",
  "col_left L20: the hyphen of «al-Fishtālī» is printed as a point at mid height.",
  "col_left L21, L23, L30: specks far to the right of «272-273.» (L21), between «et» and «n.» (L23) and in the margin before «fractiones» (L30) are not transcribed.",
  "col_left L25: «α» and «ϑ» are Greek (ϑ the open form of theta).",
  "col_left L33: the commas after «322» (short, 1.3 by 1.9 points) and after «329» are commas with tails, though they look like points at low resolution.",
  "col_left L32: «Fréret» is printed with an acute over the first e.",
  "col_left L34, L35: a blank line separates the names in F from those in G.",
  "col_left L37: the Hebrew «גּבְהוּת» is vowelled: dagesh in the gimel, šᵉwā under the bet, šūrūq (the dot of the vav) before the tav; the gimel has no vowel sign. Read at 10,000 dpi.",
  "col_left L38, L40, L43, L45: «Ǵābir», «Ǵa‘far» and «al-Ǵādirī» have the capital Ǵ with its acute; «Aflaḥ», «al-Ḥarrānī» and «ar-Raḥmān» have the dotted ḥ and Ḥ.",
  "col_right L8: «Gamĕlī’ēl» is printed with a breve over the first e, a bar over the i (2.4 by 1.1 points), the sign of hamza ’ (its head above, its tail turning down to the left) and a bar over the second e (2.4 by 1.0); the mark under the G is the top of the acute of the Ǵ of Ǵamshīd in the line below.",
  "col_right L10: «*gaocithra*» is printed in italics.",
  "col_right L17: the hyphen of «al-Ǵayhānī» is printed as a point at mid height.",
  "col_right L21-L26: the names an-Nadīm, Reinaud, Sprenger, Brockelmann, al-Muqaddasī and Marquart are letter-spaced.",
  "col_right L22: «Ḥ. Kh.» (Ḥāǵǵī Khalīfah) has the dot under the H; «V, 518» is printed with a thin space after the comma.",
  "col_right L23: «Aboulféda» is printed with an acute over the e and «à» with a grave."
 ],
